# https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isrc node1353
node1353 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>isrc</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isrc' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isrc</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;International Standard Recording Code (ISRC) &lt;https://isrc.ifpi.org/isrc-standard&gt; is a unique 12-character alphanumeric identifier for sound recordings and music video recordings standardized by ISO 3901 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/64817.html&gt;. While the &quot;ISRC&quot; label and grouping hyphens used for human readability, they shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., USCA28900153).&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;International Standard Recording Code (ISRC) &lt;https://isrc.ifpi.org/isrc-standard&gt; is a unique 12-character alphanumeric identifier for sound recordings and music video recordings standardized by ISO 3901 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/64817.html&gt;. While the &quot;ISRC&quot; label and grouping hyphens used for human readability, they shall be omitted when the identifier is stored electronically (e.g., USCA28900153).&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
